<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 6.9 points to 782.6 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 6.9 points to 782.6 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 6.9 points, or 0.89 percent, on Wednesday to 782.6, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices gained, with the transport index rising the most, up 36.5 points, or 3.17 percent, to 1,188.3 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
